{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>善存甜睡益生菌配方30粒裝（Centrum Sweet Sleep Probiotics）邊度買平？新假期整理屈臣氏、萬寧、Market Place及龍豐共4間零售商的網店報價。以同款單盒標價計，最低與次低相差HK$69，約22%。</p>\n<h2>善存甜睡益生菌配方30粒裝各網店報價</h2>\n<table>\n<thead></thead>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>零售商</strong></th>\n<th><strong>單盒標價</strong></th>\n<th><strong>單盒總額</strong></th>\n<th><strong>計價條件</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>最低已核實｜龍豐</strong></td>\n<td><strong>HK$250</strong></td>\n<td><strong>HK$250</strong></td>\n<td><strong>單盒標價</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Market Place</td>\n<td>HK$319</td>\n<td>HK$319</td>\n<td>單盒標價</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>屈臣氏</td>\n<td>HK$319</td>\n<td>HK$319</td>\n<td>單盒標價</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>萬寧</td>\n<td>HK$319</td>\n<td>HK$319</td>\n<td>單盒標價</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>善存甜睡益生菌配方30粒裝單盒價錢點計？</h2>\n<p>買一盒善存甜睡益生菌配方30粒裝，龍豐的同款網上標價為HK$250，較表列次低標價HK$319少HK$69。善存甜睡益生菌配方30粒裝這個價差以單盒商品標價比較。若打算買多件，宜另計商戶的購買條件及結帳價。</p>\n<p>以上為2026年11月14日商戶網上報價，未計運費，價格、優惠及供應以商戶為準。網店來源：<a href=\"https://www.watsons.com.hk/zh-hk/%E5%96%84%E5%AD%98-%E5%96%84%E5%AD%98%E7%94%9C%E7%9D%A1%E7%9B%8A%E7%94%9F%E8%8F%8C%E9%85%8D%E6%96%B930%E7%B2%92/p/BP_819818\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">屈臣氏</a><a href=\"https://www.mannings.com.hk/zh-hant/centrum-sleep-probiotics-30-capsules/p/749747\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">萬寧</a><a href=\"https://www.marketplacehk.com/zh-hant/wellcome/p/product/i/116581141.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Market Place</a><a href=\"https://eshop.lungfung.hk/product/mdn250124/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">龍豐</a></p>\n<p>這款配方含益生菌。益生菌是活微生物，研究所見的作用視乎菌株及用途而異。這次格價不評估本配方的睡眠效果。如對成分或服用有疑問，建議先諮詢醫生或其他合資格的醫護專業人士。<a href=\"https://ods.od.nih.gov/factsheets/Probiotics-Consumer/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">NIH ODS：益生菌</a></p>\n<p>計算方法：（較高標價－較低標價）÷較高標價×100%。本次以（HK$319－HK$250）÷HK$319×100%計，約22%。上述比例未計運費及額外活動，亦不代表全港最低價、歷史低價或不同包裝版本的配方已完全核實一致。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179463242257576209_13879933606af7eae6f0a11.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"善存甜睡益生菌配方30粒裝格價：龍豐 HK$250，單盒約平22%\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179463242257576209_13879933606af7eae6f0a11.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a></p>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>點樣先可以用圖中價格買到善存甜睡益生菌配方30粒裝？<i></i></p>\n<p>以2026年11月14日網上報價，龍豐的單盒商品總額為HK$250。條件為單盒標價，未計運費。</p>\n<p>今次格價比較哪一款包裝？<i></i></p>\n<p>比較的是甜睡益生菌配方30粒裝，不包括善存其他益生菌配方。</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T05:20:02.113965+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":778,"images":1,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T05:00:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T05:53:57.698292+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T05:13:27.645863+00:00","content_hash":"0b412a0c70ac5de62b6e48137c662e39be57c0471796a2bf7f49220ceb4d957a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}